    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d105-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d105-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Carter Library, National Security Council, Institutional Files, Box 86,
                        SCC 016, 6/14/77, Indian Ocean. Secret. The
                    meeting took place in the White House Situation Room. Brzezinski sent the Summary of Conclusions to
                        Mondale, Vance, Brown, Warnke, and
                        Turner under a June 17 memorandum
                    that indicated Carter had seen and
                    approved it. Brzezinski also attached a
                    tentative schedule for a 3-year phased program of Indian Ocean demilitarization,
                    indicating that it was prepared by the NSC
                    Staff and approved by Carter.
                    (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
